      "Original": "[PlatePeek] Probe ON. Open Edit Plate, change each design dropdown by one step, toggle Invert, then run /platepeek probe again to stop.",
      "Context": "DesignProbe.Enable",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ IChatGui.Print",
      "Translated": "[PlatePeek] 已开启探测。打开「编辑铭牌」，将每个设计下拉框切换一个选项，再切换「反转」，最后再次输入 /platepeek probe 停止。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
